{"id":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter1#ex:graphs-are-kg1","title":"ex:graphs-are-kg1","path":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter1.md","line":870,"body":"","kind":"other","status":"not_started","tex":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter1.tex#ex:graphs-are-kg1","uses":["[[references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter1#def:k-g-1-space]]","[[references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter1#prop:fundamental-group-of-graph-is-free]]","[[references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter1#lem:covering-space-of-graph-is-graph]]"],"inspired_by":[],"bindings":[],"is_index":false,"body_html":"","formal":[],"tex_content":{"path":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter1.tex","label":"ex:graphs-are-kg1","line":1316,"source":"\\begin{example}[Graphs, surfaces, and lens spaces as $K(G,1)$'s]\n\\label{ex:graphs-are-kg1}\n\\uses{def:k-g-1-space, prop:fundamental-group-of-graph-is-free, lem:covering-space-of-graph-is-graph}\n\\dcref{ch1:1B.5}\n\\group{Fundamental Group}\n\nConnected graphs are $K(F,1)$ spaces for free $F$. Also $\\RP^\\infty$ is a\n$K(\\Z_2,1)$, $S^\\infty/\\Z_m$ is a $K(\\Z_m,1)$, and products of $K(G,1)$\nspaces are $K(G\\times H,1)$; in particular $T^n$ is a $K(\\Z^n,1)$.\n\\end{example}","html":" <p></p>\\begin{example} \\end{example}[Graphs, surfaces, and lens spaces as <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$K(G,1)$\">$K(G,1)$</span>&#x27;s] <span class=\"tex-label\" id=\"tex-label-65783a6772617068732d6172652d6b6731\"></span> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FHatcher%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter1%23def%3Ak-g-1-space\">↗ def:k-g-1-space</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FHatcher%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter1%23prop%3Afundamental-group-of-graph-is-free\">↗ prop:fundamental-group-of-graph-is-free</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FHatcher%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter1%23lem%3Acovering-space-of-graph-is-graph\">↗ lem:covering-space-of-graph-is-graph</a> <span class=\"tex-source-references\" role=\"list\" style=\"display:block\"><span class=\"tex-dcref\" role=\"listitem\" style=\"display:block\">1. ch1:1B.5</span></span>\\group Fundamental Group <p></p>Connected graphs are <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$K(F,1)$\">$K(F,1)$</span> spaces for free <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$F$\">$F$</span>. Also <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\RP ^\\infty $\">$\\RP ^\\infty $</span> is a <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$K(\\Z _2,1)$\">$K(\\Z _2,1)$</span>, <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$S^\\infty /\\Z _m$\">$S^\\infty /\\Z _m$</span> is a <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$K(\\Z _m,1)$\">$K(\\Z _m,1)$</span>, and products of <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$K(G,1)$\">$K(G,1)$</span> spaces are <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$K(G\\times H,1)$\">$K(G\\times H,1)$</span>; in particular <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$T^n$\">$T^n$</span> is a <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$K(\\Z ^n,1)$\">$K(\\Z ^n,1)$</span>. \\end{example}","warnings":["部分 TeX 排版细节未完整还原（已保留可读内容）: example、group"]},"previous":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter1#def:k-g-1-space","next":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter1#ex:knot-complement-in-s3-kg1","relations":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter1#def:k-g-1-space","title":"def:k-g-1-space","label":"def:k-g-1-space"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter1#prop:fundamental-group-of-graph-is-free","title":"prop:fundamental-group-of-graph-is-free","label":"prop:fundamental-group-of-graph-is-free"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter1#lem:covering-space-of-graph-is-graph","title":"lem:cov